{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43278","headline":"登圣善寺阁望龙门 · 成㟧","name":"登圣善寺阁望龙门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高阁聊登望，遥分禹凿门。\n刹连多宝塔，树满给孤园。\n香境超三界，清流振陆浑。\n报慈弘孝理，行道得真源。\n空净祥烟霁，时光受日温。\n愿从初地起，长奉下生尊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"成㟧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43278.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43278","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}